{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "lacunae indicated as 1-2 verses ISSUE!!! there is a strong irregularity in the numbering of the lines here. lacunae are not numbered, the progression starts again from Κρήτη!"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.1", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Διὰ παντὸς, ὦ Θεόφραστε, καθάπερ οἶσθα σύ,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.2", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἴδιόν τι πλάττων, κοὐχὶ τὸν ἑτέρων πόνον,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.3", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὅπερ ἐνιοι ποιοῦσʼ ἐμαυτοῦ τιθέμενος"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.4", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "νῦν ἱστόρηκα τὴν ἅπασαν Ἑλλάδα,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.5", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὑποταττομένας ταύτη δὲ τὰς ἑξῆς πόλεις,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.6", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "στοιχεῖον οὐκ ἄμουσον ἅμα θʼ Ἑλληνικόν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.7", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἱκανήν τε παρέχον διατριβὴν τοῖς δυναμένοις"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.8", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὀρθῶς συνιδεῖν ἕκαστα. Τὰ γὰρ ἐν πλείοσιν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.9", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὑπὸ τῶν παλαιῶν συγγραφέων εἰρημένα,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.10", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ταῦτʼ ἐμμέτρως ῥηθήσετ᾿ ἐν βραχεῖ χρόνῳ,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.11", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὅπερ ἐστὶν ἱκανῶς δύναμιν ἰσχυρὰν ἔχον·"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.12", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὑπολαμβάνω γὰρ ἀσφαλῶς ἡμῖν ἔχειν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.13", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κεῖσθαί τε τὰς μάλιστα διασήμους πόλεις,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.14", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἄλση, ποταμοὺς, νήσους τε τοὺς διάπλους τε καί"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.15", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "λιμένας, ἅ τʼ ἐκτὶν ἐν Πελοποννήσῳ γένη"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.16", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "λεγόμενα χὡμοροῦντ᾿ ἑαυτοῖς κατὰ τόπους,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.17", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἵνα μηδὲ ἕν σε τὸ σύνολον διαλανθάνῃ,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.18", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "φανερῶς ἑκάστων ὁμολόγως τε κειμένων,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.19", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὥστ᾿ ἀναλαβόντα καὶ διὰ μνήμης ἔχειν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.20", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "νωθρὰν γὰρ οὐχ εὕροις ἂν, ἀλλʼ ἐσπευσμένην"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.21", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "τὴν πραγματείαν· διὸ σεαυτὸν μὴ βραδύν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.22", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὁλοσχερῶς ἐπὶ ταῦτα δοὺς καὶ σπουδάσας"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.23", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "συμφιλομάθησον, καθάπερ εἴωθας ποιεῖν."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.24", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Τῆς Ἑλλέδος ἐστὶν Ἀμβρακία πρώτη πόλις."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.25", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Αὕτη δʼ ἀποικία λέγεται Κορινθίων"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.26", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "εἶναι. Κατὰ τὸν κόλπον δὲ τὸν καλούμενον"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.27", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἀμβρακικὸν ᾤκισται μέση, σταδίους δʼ ἔχει"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.28", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἀπὸ τῆς θαλάττης δγδοήκοντʼ. ἐπιφανὲς δʼ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.29", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἱερὸν Ἀθηνᾶς ἐστ᾿ ἐν αὐτῇ καὶ λιμήν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.30", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κλειστός. Καλεῖται Δρυοπὶς ἡ χώρα δʼ ὅλη."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.31", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἡ δʼ Ἑλλὰς ἀπὸ τῆς Ἀμβρακίας εἶναι δοκεῖ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.32", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "μάλιστα συνεχῆς· τὸ πέρας αὐτῆς δʼ ἔρχεται"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.33", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐπὶ τὸν ποταμὸν Πηνειὸν, ὡς Φιλέας γράφει,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.34", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὄρος τε Μαγνήτων Ὁμόλην κεκλημένον."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.35", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Τινὲς δὲ τὴν Μαγνησίαν τῆς Ἑλλέδος"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.36", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "λέγουσιν εἶναι, τὸν δὲ Φιλέαν ἀγνοεῖν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.37", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἀποχωρίσαντα, τεῦτο δʼ εἶναι συμφανές"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.38", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "τοῖς φιλομαθεῖν μάλιστα φιλοτιμουμένοις."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.39", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Πλὴν ἐπὶ τὰ λοιπὰ τοῦ λόγου προβήσομαι."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.40", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἀπʼ Ἀμβρακίας εἰς Θετταλίαν τριῶν ὁδός"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.41", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἔσθʼ ἡμερῶν. Ἔχει δὲ ποταμὸν λεγόμενον"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.42", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἄρατθον εἰς θάλατταν ἐξιόντα, καί"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.43", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὄρος πρόσεστιν ἱερὸν ἐπικεκλημένον."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.44", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Σταδίων δʼ ὁ παράπλους ἐστὶν ἑκατὸν εἴκοσιν."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.45", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Εἶτα μετὰ ταύτην εἰσʼ Ὀρέσται λεγόμενοι·"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.46", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "εἶτ᾿ Ἀμφιλοχία δʼ ἄργος ἐνταῦθʼ ἔστι τό"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.47", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἀμφιλοχικόν. Μετὰ τοῦτʼ Ἀκαρνᾶνες· πόλεις"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.48", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "οὗτοι δʼ ἔχουσι πλείονας, καὶ Λευκάδα,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.49", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἀφʼ ἧς μέγας ἐστὶ κόλπος εἰς Ἰσθμὸν φέρων."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.50", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Νῆσοι Κεφαλλήνων δʼ ἐν αὐτῷ κείμεναι·"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.51", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἰθάκη σταδίων ὡς ὀγδοήκοντα, στενή,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.52", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὕψος δʼ ἔχουσα καὶ λιμένας τρεῖς· ἐχομένη"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.53", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πρὸς ἐκπέραν δʼ οἰκοῦσι τῆς Αἰτωλίας"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.54", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἱερὸν δʼ ὕπεστιν Ἡρακλέους καλούμενον,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.55", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἕτερον δʼ Ἀφροδίτης. Ποταμὸν ἡ χώρα δʼ ἔχει"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.56", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἀχελῷον. Ἡμερῶν δὶ καὶ νυκτῶν δύο"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.57", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἔσθʼ ὁ παράπλους αὐτῆς. Ἔχεται δʼ Αἰτωλία,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.58", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐν ᾗ πόλις Πλευρὼν ὑπόκειται, χἱερόν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.59", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἅγιον Ἀθηνᾶς ἐστιν ὠνομασμένον."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.60", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἔπειτα Καλυδὼν, εἶτεν αἵ τʼ Ἐχινάδες"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.61", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "νῆσοι ποταμός τʼ Εὔηνος ἐκ Πίνδου ῥέων."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.62", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Οὗτοι Δολόπων οἰκοῦσι πρὸς μεσημβρίαν·"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.63", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "παράπλους δὲ ταύτης ἐστὶν ἡμέρας μιᾶς."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.64", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Εἶλτα μετὰ ταύτην ἡ Λοκρὶς καλουμένη,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.65", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐν ᾗ πόλις Ναύπακτος· εἶθ᾿ ὑποκείμενος"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.66", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "λιμὴν μέγας πόλις τε Τολοφών. Μετὰ δὲ τήν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.67", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Τολοφῶνα ποταμός ἐσθ᾿ Ὕλαιθος λεγόμενος·"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.68", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "τοῦτον δὲ ῥεῖν λέγουσιν ἐξ Αἰτωλίας."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.69", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ὁ πᾶς δὲ παράπλους οὐδʼ ὅλης ἔσθ᾿ ἡμέρας."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.70", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Οὗτοι κατοικοῦσιν δὲ πρὸς μεσημβρίαν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.71", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Αἰτωλίας, Λέλεγες τὸ πρὶν κεκλημένοι."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.72", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἔπειτα Φωκεῖς εἰσι Λοκρῶν ἐχόμενοι,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.73", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "παῤ οἷς πεδίον Κρισαῖον. Ἀπὸ Κίρρας δʼ ἄνω"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.74", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "προβάντι Δελφῶν πόλις ὕπεστι χἱερόν,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.75", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐν τὸ μαντεῖον, ὅ τε Παρνασός, μέγα"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.76", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "καὶ σύσκιον ὄρος, εἶτα νυμφῶν ἐχόμενον"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.77", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Κωρύκιον ἄντρον· εἶτεν Ἀντικύρα πόλις"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.78", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ποταμός τε Κηφισὸς ῥέων ἐκ Φωκίδος."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.79", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Παράπλους δὲ ταύτης ἡμέρας ἔσθʼ οὐχ ὅλης."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.80", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐν τῇ μεσογείᾳ δʼ ἐστὶ Κυπάρισσος πόλις"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.81", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Κρῖσά τε, μετʼ αὐτὴν Δαυλίς. Ἡ Βοιωτία"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.82", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "χώρα δὲ μετὰ Φωκεῖς ὑπόκειται, κειμένη"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.83", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "τῆς Φωκίδος χώρας πρὸς ἕω· κἄστιν δύο"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.84", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐπίσημ᾿ ὄρη, τὸ μὲν Ἑλικὼν καλούμενον,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.85", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἕτερον Κιθαιρών. Εἶτεν Ὠρωπὸς πόλις,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.86", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "καὶ τῆς θαλάττης ἀπέχον ἱερὸν οὐ πολύ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.87", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἔστʼ Ἀμφιαράου καὶ νεὼς καὶ τὸ τέμενος,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.88", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Αὐλίς τε Βοιωτῶν πόλις, πρὸς ᾗ λιμήν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.89", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κἀρτέμιδος ἱερὸν ἅγιον, ὃ λέγεται κτίσαι"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.90", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἀγαμέμνονʼ, εἶτεν Ἐρέσιον καλούμενον"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.91", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἀκρότατον, εἶτ᾿ Εὔριιπος. Ἀνθηδὼν δʼ ἔχει"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.92", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἀνθηδόνιον τὸν λιμένα· καὶ μετʼ οὐ πολύ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.93", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Τάναγρα. Κεῖται δʼ ἐν μεσογεία πάνυ καλή"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.94", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πόλις, μεγάλαι Θῆβαι, σταδίων τὸ περίμετρον"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.95", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἔχουσα τετταράκοντα καὶ προσέτι τριῶν,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.96", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Κῶπαι πόλις κὠρχομενός· εἶτα μετʼ οὐ πολύ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.97", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πόλις Λεβάδεια χἱερὸν Τροφωνίου,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.98", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὅπου τὸ μαντεῖον λέγουσι γεγονέναι."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.99", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Εἶτʼ Ὠκαλέα πόλις ἐστὶ καὶ Μεδεών. Μετά"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.100", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ταύτην ὑπόκειται Θεσπιὰ, κᾆτʼ ἐχομένη"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.101", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἡ προσαγορευομένη Πλαταιαὶ, μετὰ δέ τις"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.102", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πόλις ὑπόκειται Νῖσα. Μῆκός ἐστι τῆς"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.103", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Βοιωτίας στάδι’, ὡς λέγεται, πεντακόσια,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.104", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "διακόσια δὲ χἁβδομήκοντʼ ἐστὶ τό"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.105", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πλάτος. Ποταμοὺς ἔχει δὲ τὸν μέν λεγόμενον"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.106", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἰσμηνὸν Ἀσωπόν τε, πεδία δʼ εὔυδρα"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.107", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "παρακείμενʼ ἔστʼ· ἔπειτα χώρα Μεγαρέων."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.108", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἐντεῦθεν ἀρχή τῆς Πελοποννήσου"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.109", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Λιμήν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.110", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "χωστὸς ὑπόκειται καὶ Λέχαιον λεγομένη"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1.111", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πόλις"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ΔΙΚΑΙΑΡΧΟΥ ΑΝΑΓΡΑΦΗ ΣΛΛΑΔΟΣ. the subscriptio is in [], but seems not to be in the codex. I can't find any explanation in the notes"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.110", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Κρήτη τίς ἐστι κατὰ Κύθηρα κειμένη"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.111", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "νῆσος περίκλυστος· ἔστι δʼ αὐτῆς τὸ μέγεθος"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.112", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "δισχιλίων καὶ πεντακοσίων που σχεδόν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.113", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "σταδίων· ἀπασῶν δʼ ἐστὶ πελαγιωτάτη,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.114", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "στενὴ δὲ τελέως· ἐν δὲ ταύτη τρία γένη"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.115", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐποικίαν ἔσχηκεν Ἑλλήνων· τὸ μέν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.116", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Λακεδαιμονίων, ἔπειτεν Ἀργείων, τὸ δέ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.117", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἀπὸ τῶν Ἀθηναίων· ἔχει δὲ βάρβαρα"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.118", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "αὐτόχθονα γένη. Φασὶ δʼ ἐν Κρήτη πόλιν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.119", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "εἶναι Φαλάσαρνα κειμένην πρὸς ἥλιον"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.120", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "δύνοντα, κλειστὸν λιμένʼ ἔχουσαν χἱερόν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.121", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἀρτέμιδος ἅγιον, καὶ καλεῖσθαι τὴν θεόν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.122", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Δίκτυνναν· εἶτεν Ἀπτεραίαν λεγομένην"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.123", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐν τῆ μεσογείᾳ· κᾆτα Κνωσσὸν ἐχομένην"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.124", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "καὶ πρὸς νότον Γόρτυναν· ἄλλαι τʼ εἰσὶν ἐν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.125", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Κρήτῃ πόλεις, ἅς ἐστιν ἐργῶδες φράσαι."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.126", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ποταμοὺς δʼ ἔχει Ληθαῖον, εἶτα λεγομένους"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.127", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Διδύμους, ἔπειτα Μαινόμενον, εἴτ’ ἐχόμενον"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.128", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Κεδρισὸν Ἀμφιμέλαν τε καὶ Μεσσάπολιν,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.129", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὄρος τε Δικτυνναῖον ἐπὶ δυσμὰς φέρον."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.130", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Τὰς δὲ Κυκλάδας νήσους ὁρῶμεν κειμένας"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.131", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὑπὲρ Γεραιστοῦ, πρὸς δὲ τὴν μεσημβρίαν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.132", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "οὔσας μὲν Εὐβοίας, περιεχούσας δὲ τό"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.133", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πέλαγος τὸ Μυρτῷον λεγόμενον, ἔτι δὲ καί"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.134", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "τῆς Ἀττικῆς χώρας μετεχούσας παντελῶς."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.135", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἐγγὺς Κέως πρώτη τετράπολις Σουνίου"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.136", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "νῆσος ὑπόκειται καὶ λιμήν· ἔχεται Κύθνος"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.137", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "νῆσος πόλις τ᾿, εἶτιν Σέριφος καὶ λιμήν,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.138", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἔπειτα Σίφνος καὶ Κίμωλος ἐχομένη . . ."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.139", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἔχουσα λιμένας δύο· μετʼ αὐτὴν δʼ ἐστὶν ἡ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.140", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Δῆλος ἱερὰ νῆσος λεγομένη, καὶ λιμήν"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.141", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "νεώς τε τἀπόλλωνος, εἶτεν ἐχομένη"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.142", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Μύκονος· μετὰ ταύτην Τῆνός ἐστι καὶ λιμήν,"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.143", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἄνδρος τε νῆσος καὶ κατὰ Γέραιστον λιμήν."}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.144", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Αὗται μέν εἰσι Κυκλάδες, ἕτεραι λεγόμεναι"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.145", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Σποράδες, ἐκ αἷσι Μῆλοε, εἶτεν οὐ πολύ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.146", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἀπέχουσα Θήρα νῆσος, εἶτεν οὐ πολύ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.147", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἴος, εἶτα Νάξος· μετὰ δὲ ταύτην πελαγία"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.148", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Σκῦρος· κατʼ Εὔβοιαν δʼ ὁρῶμεν κειμένην"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.149", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "αὐτήν· ἀπὸ ταύτης ἐστὶν ἀπέχουσʼ οὐ πολύ"}
{"urn": "dionysius-geography.descriptio-graeciae", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2.150", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "νῆσος Πεπάρηθος ἡ τρίπολις καλουμένη"}
